The `finish()` function re-renders the entire `botBubble.innerHTML` with `markdownToHTML(accumulated, true)`. 

The problem is the sequence of operations: text chunks update the bubble with markdown rendering, then the export chunk sets the download URL and info text, but when the done chunk arrives and calls `finish()`, it re-renders the entire innerHTML which wipes out those export details we just added. I need to preserve the export URL and info text after the re-render completes.

